data: {"id": "c04aafe9c7c049b4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1237", "run_id": "c04aafe9c7c049b4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 |\n|---|---|\n| **Pod YAML** | `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T05:47:05Z`；`terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 3900` (65分钟)；`finalizers: <none>`；`phase: Running`；单容器 app，无 volume 挂载（仅定义 emptyDir `state`） |\n| **Events** | 仅有一条：`Killing — Stopping container app`（47秒前） |\n| **Node** | `node2` 状态为 `Ready`，无 NotReady/Unknown |\n| **Topology** | Pod 调度在 node2，无 ownerReferences（独立 Pod，非控制器管理），无 Service 关联 |\n| **Logs** | 最近 30 分钟仅一条 `\"application started\"`；无 PreStop 输出、无 error/warn |\n| **Tra", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789360993121, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

